{"product_id":"caiden","title":"Caiden Warrior \u0026 Fighter","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCaiden Warrior Cue Tip\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eCaiden Warrior Cue Tip\u003c\/strong\u003e is designed to deliver dependable performance, excellent cue ball control, and consistent playability. Constructed from premium multi-layer leather, it provides a solid, responsive hit with enhanced chalk retention to help minimize miscues and maximize shot accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for durability and consistency, the Caiden Warrior maintains its shape through extended play, making it an excellent choice for players seeking reliable performance at an exceptional value. Available in multiple hardness options to suit every playing style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium multi-layer leather construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent chalk retention for improved grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsistent feel and reliable cue ball control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable design with long-lasting shape retention\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReduces miscues for greater confidence on every shot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in \u003cstrong\u003eSuper Soft (SS), Soft (S), Medium (M), and Hard (H)\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e14mm diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/strong\u003e Recreational, league, and competitive players looking for a durable, high-performance cue tip that offers excellent control, consistency, and value.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Hard","offer_id":43442232426544,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":43442232459312,"sku":null,"price":1800.0,"curren